# Close Workbook Workflow

## Phase order

Work moves through the close in this order. Do not start a phase until the one before it has passing tie-out tests.

| Phase | Deliverable | Done when |
|---|---|---|
| 0 Skeleton | `src/` step stubs, `tests/` stubs, empty `output/` | `pytest -q tests/` collects and runs |
| 1 Sources & validation | Loaders for every file in `data/raw/`, control totals recorded | Row counts and totals match the source; JEs balance |
| 2 Reconciliations | `output/recon-<account>-<period>.md` + unmatched list | Difference is 0.00 or every reconciling item is listed |
| 3 Flux analysis | `output/flux-<period>.md` | Every line over materiality has an explanation or an "owner to explain" flag |
| 4 JE testing | `output/je-test-<period>.md` + exceptions CSV | Every test ran; every exception listed with JE ID and source row |
| 5 Close memo | `output/close-memo-<period>.md` | Tie-out checker passes; open items have an owner and a date |

## Before any analysis

1. Read the close plan in `docs/` or `plans/interface-contract.md`. It must state the period, the entity (Northwind Co.), the accounts in scope, and the materiality threshold. If materiality is missing, stop and ask.
2. List every source file in `data/raw/` with row count and control total. Write that list to the plan or `docs/sources.md`.
3. Confirm the opening balances tie to last period's closing balances.

## Where files go

| Kind | Folder | Rule |
|---|---|---|
| Source extracts | `data/raw/` | Read-only. Never edited, renamed or overwritten |
| Work copies | `data/interim/` | Rebuilt by code. Safe to delete |
| Step code | `src/` | One module per workpaper |
| Tie-out tests | `tests/` | One test file per workpaper |
| Reports, exception lists, proposed JEs | `output/` | Rebuilt by code. Never edited by hand |
| Plans, memos, notes | `docs/`, `plans/` | Written by people and commands |

## Every session ends with

- `pytest -q tests/` passing, or the failure written into the transition doc
- The `tie-out-checker` agent run on anything new in `output/`
- No change under `data/raw/` (`git status data/raw/` is clean)

## In-session commands

| Need | Command |
|---|---|
| Bank or sub-ledger to GL | `/acct-reconcile` |
| Budget vs actual, month over month | `/acct-variance` |
| Journal entry testing | `/acct-je-test` |
| Close memo and handoff | `/acct-close-handoff` |
